  "analysis": "Good! I can successfully fetch streamflow data. The data shows discharge values in cubic feet per second (cfs) for April 1-7, 2025. However, I need to determine what constitutes a 'flood'. Let me check if there's flood stage information available. I should look for additional parameters or check if there's a way to get flood stage thresholds.",
